The first full self-test is clean through G8. At the shipping preset the exact candidate space is 4,020,025 with one valid replacement; all five no-tool attacks failed over eight seeds, while the required exact scan solved 8/8 and used up to 914,850 signed additions. G9 is intentionally still marked unrun. I’m independently expanding the demo metric now to cross-check every fast verification decision against literal MUFL costs.
