The independent expansion matched the fast checker on all 169 demo swaps, including the exact planted cost decrease, so the metric shortcut is sound. I’m starting the script-owned four-vendor bare hardening run now; it begins at the 53,608-character easy instance and will escalate only if an oracle returns a verified swap.
