 NOTES = r"""
-Paper definition and regime.  Section 1.1 defines weighted metric
-uncapacitated facility location (MUFL), and Section 1.2 defines the MUFL/Swap
-neighbourhood: one may add, drop, or replace at most one open facility.  This
