codex
The bare hardening loop succeeded at medium: easy was solved by 1/3 oracles, while all three medium oracles failed. I’m promoting `medium` (\(n=2{,}500{,}049\)) to the shipping preset, remeasuring every deterministic gate there, then running the structural-hint and placebo arms in isolated directories.
