Implemented a verified Track-B MUFL generator based on the paper’s Section 3 reduction.

Completed:

- [Generator](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1612.01752/gen_1612_01752.py)
- [README](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1612.01752/README.md)
- [Self-test report](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1612.01752/selftest_report.json)
