    18	
    19	## What the family asks
    20	
    21	The solver receives a compact, exact weighted metric uncapacitated facility-
    22	location instance and a current open set. It must give one facility to close and
    23	its closed complementary mate to open, strictly decreasing cost. The metric and
    24	weights are exactly those in Brauer's [*Complexity of Single-Swap Heuristics for
    25	Metric Facility Location and Related Problem*](https://arxiv.org/abs/1612.01752).
    26	`verify` decodes the pair, evaluates one cubic modulo `p`, and compares the exact
    27	integer clause-weight gain; it accepts any improving replacement and never reads
    28	the planted answer. An independent `Fraction`-based evaluator agreed with it on
    29	all 4,225 replacements for each of 25 demo seeds.
    30	
    31	Generation is inverse, not search. The generator samples `a != 0` and `b`, knows
    32	the unique index satisfying `(a*i+b)^3 = -1 (mod p)`, and only then publishes the
    33	expanded cubic. Because `p = 2 mod 3`, cubing permutes the field. Balanced clauses
    34	make the flip gain `2*s*(P(i)-(p-2))-1`, positive exactly at that index. Section 3
    35	then carries this flip to the MUFL swap.
    36	
    37	## Why Track B
    38	
    39	The paper's Theorem 1 proves tight PLS-completeness for weighted MUFL/Swap, via
    40	Proposition 3. That worst-case theorem is not asserted for this generated
    41	distribution. Indeed, an exact scan solves every generated instance in `O(n)`:
    42	at shipping seed 4242 it examines 1,090,108 candidates, performs 14,171,404
    43	counted exact operations, and takes about 0.44–0.51 seconds locally. The compact
    44	route recognizes the cubic as `(a*i+b)^3`, recovers the affine form in the field,
    45	and takes 62 counted operations. Executing either millions of trials or dozens
    46	of six-to-seven-digit modular products is out of reach by hand without tools.
    47	
    48	The reduction requires client weights. Section 5 explicitly leaves unweighted
    49	variants open; the generator does not claim that easier/unknown regime. It also
    50	asks for one improving move, not the PSPACE-hard endpoint of a prescribed local-
    51	search trajectory.
    52	
    53	## Worked demo (`n=11`, seed 0)
    54	
    55	This smallest setting is hand-solvable: evaluate the eleven cubic residues (or
