    86	symmetry, and distance 0 at a point define the whole metric. The cost of an open
    87	set is opening cost plus, for every client, its weight times the distance to its
    88	nearest open facility.
    89	
    90	The clause clients follow this exact rule. For each ordinary i=0,...,p-1, let
