codex
Implemented and verified a Track B weighted-MUFL single-replacement generator based on the paper’s Section 3 reduction ([paper](https://arxiv.org/pdf/1612.01752)).

Key results:

- All G1–G9 gated checks pass.
- Exact direct-cost validation covered 4,225 demo swaps.
- Guessing: 0/200,000; exact density \(1/2{,}500{,}051\).
- Generic Frobenius-GCD algorithm: 872 exact operations.
- Intended affine-cube shortcut: 62 operations.
- Bare oracle loop hardened at `medium`, 0/3 successful attempts.
- Placebo arm: 0/3.
- Structural arm: 0/2; the third attempt was blocked by the OpenRouter account limit. This is recorded as a non-gating diagnostic.

Deliverables:

- [Generator module](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1612.01752/gen_1612_01752.py)
- [README](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1612.01752/README.md)
- [Self-test report](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1612.01752/selftest_report.json)
- [Bare hardening transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1612.01752/llm_loop_transcript.jsonl)
- [Hinted transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1612.01752/g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl)
- [Placebo transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1612.01752/g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl)
